	"overview": {
		"goal": {
			"en": "Give macOS app developers a reusable SwiftUI workspace for arranging their own content in resizable panels. The SDK handles grid geometry, snapping and panel identity; the included demo shows the interactions with sample content kept only for the current session.",
			"zh": "为 macOS 应用开发者提供可复用的 SwiftUI 工作区，把自己的内容放进可调整大小的面板。SDK 处理网格几何、吸附与面板身份；附带演示应用展示这些交互，示例内容仅在本次运行中保留。"
		},
